# Honored by ripgrep and the agent Grep tool. Bulk data and generated output:
# a match inside these costs tokens and is never the place to edit. Opt out
# when you must search them: `rg -uu PATTERN` (or --no-ignore).
# The rule is elastic/prism's (#10025, ported by elastic/prism#10032):
# https://github.com/elastic/prism/blob/main/contributing/agent-orchestration.md
# tests/test_ignore_hides_only_data_10032.py fails if a pattern here hides no
# tracked file, or hides hand-written code.

# The committed build output (README → "The built catalog is committed")
golden-catalog/

# Golden slices of that build, one per type
tests/data/golden_slices/

# Prototype previews and their sample records, written by build_preview*.py
prototypes/retail_drawings/*.html
prototypes/retail_drawings/*.ndjson

# Lock file, written by uv
uv.lock

# elastic/prism's file-size gate, vendored byte for byte (vendor/prism/PIN.txt).
# Never the place to edit: change it in core and resync (docs/file-size-budget.md).
vendor/
